From 1b9d8a7994366d2f40c14ccfa8eaffa4050490c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bsp2020 <bsp2020@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 21:54:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] hc-mix: Q8_0 up + collapse in one launch, F32 inject rows
 first on the down grid (GGML_CUDA_HC_UP_FUSE=0: off)

hc_mix_up_collapse_q8 replays 8 hc_mix_up_silu_dot_band<8,16,NT,3,10,true,true> blocks per
workgroup (the 4 streams x 2 16-column units of 32 columns), keeps the per-warp results in LDS
and sums the gate in the band kernel's order, then runs hc_mix_collapse_inject's collapse and
Q8_1 epilogue for those columns.  The F32 inject rows run as the first blocks of
hc_mix_down_dots (GGML_CUDA_HC_INJECT_DOWN=0: a separate inject-only launch).  Bit-identical.
gfx1201, UD-IQ4_XS 4-token sites: 36.1 -> 31.9 us.

---
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/hc-mix.cu | 307 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 283 insertions(+), 24 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/hc-mix.cu b/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/hc-mix.cu
